Passing variables as a dynamic:

#! /bin/bash
echo "Please enter your username:"
read abc
echo "Please enter your password:"
read pass
echo "Your username is $abc and your password is $pass"

Output:
Please enter your username:
Sudharsan
Please enter your password:
admin@123
Your username is Sudharsan and your password is admin@123

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Passing variables as a dynamic with password invisible:

#! /bin/bash
echo "Please enter your username:"
read abc
read -sp "Enter your password" pass
echo -e "\nYour username is $abc and your password is $pass"

Output:
Please enter your username:
Sudharsan
Enter your password
Your username is Sudharsan and your password is admin@123
